{"id": 28, "ts": 1779513281.5027366, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "agent_2", "message": "I note that we still have no concrete evidence on any candidate\u2019s attention to detail or information\u2011accuracy performance\u2014a key safety criterion for long\u2011distance flights. The only related observation we have is Candidate\u202fB\u2019s weak memory for numbers, which may indicate a potential weakness in handling precise operational data. Candidate\u202fC, while strong on reliability, decision\u2011making and technical competence, still has unresolved concerns about communication and adaptability. To solidify our decision, I propose we obtain reference or simulator\u2011debrief information on each candidate\u2019s checklist compliance, numeric data handling, and overall attention to detail, prioritising Candidate\u202fB and D where we have noted possible concerns. Pending that information, I maintain a provisional recommendation for Candidate\u202fC.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
